Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.81,0:00:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next one's on its way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more time I can buy, the\Nbetter chance they have to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to run around and\Nparry every single thing I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was finally able to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this old-timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:00:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:01:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not to do the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.51,0:01:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.03,0:01:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not to do the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.94,0:01:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't have to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can just see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not to do the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.75,0:01:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.75,0:01:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the future, in the future,\NWhen a child and a body were burning,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the power of the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.63,0:02:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the horse has a\Nwhole sparkly gold outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.51,0:02:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he be standing in\Na war zone looking all fancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the poor guy is lost or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.31,0:02:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time to get distracted. Nor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stand a chance\Nif these soldiers gather
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.05,0:02:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up their weapons and\Ncome at me all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.57,0:02:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to keep parrying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep their weapons out of their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.81,0:02:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.29,0:03:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna get it too. I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,help but wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What this old guy's doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the devil just happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give the soldiers\Ntime to pick up their stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also got to remember to breathe\Nevery once in a while or I'll pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, were you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does the sparkly old man, does he know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, we've never met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But geez, he's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get hurt out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.43,0:03:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess he does have\Na sword if he needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay focused, Nora.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've just gotta keep doing your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.53,0:04:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure that sparkly gold old man\Nis going to get hurt if he stays out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you must tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why haven't you killed me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the poor guy thinks I\Ncame here to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I can't really blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, not that weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.39,0:04:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want him to be afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:05:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to do something to reassure\Nhim, to let him know I'm not hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this working?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't work at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've really been going\Nnonstop this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Low Heel can't do anything\Nto relieve exhaustion like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inez.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you get out safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooting Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drag race!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.85,0:06:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good to see you, Grill, Grizzly,\Nuh, uh, Glibbery? It's Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, you did all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to finally join us, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not know who you are, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must at least handle the cleanup,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or it will stain the honor of the\N6th Troop of the Royal Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thousand Blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember! That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the power of the swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one I've always dreamed of being!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after I warned him against\Nany excessive killing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, ho, ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a tall order, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially when we're faced\Nwith such a vast army!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.79,0:07:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, corpses will not\Nprovide us any needed intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find the living to be\Nimmensely more cooperative,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially after bringing back missing\Nlimbs over and over with healing magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.87,0:07:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.78,0:07:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't quite sound\Nlike a joke whenever you say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oaken, they should be\Narriving any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:08:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have been strung along by the\Nenemy long enough for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my time to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.97,0:08:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their eyes are as red as fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be enjoying this, Oaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.35,0:08:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good battle is always\Nriveting no matter what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how long in the tooth I may get.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, shall we add the final touches?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soul Prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our turn now. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:09:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to save all the survivors and\Nmake them turn over a new leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the instructors who\Ntaught me at the training schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm\Ngetting to see them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on. Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.55,0:09:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.69,0:09:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, but are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.01,0:09:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should really rest a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotten enough rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I can move around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am really hungry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A commanding officer confessed\Nunder Sane's interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have no more troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:10:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They already threw everything\Nat us, including the dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as all the other beasts\Nthat attacked the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.69,0:10:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid the Emperor\Nhas escaped. The Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That decrepit old fogey showed up\Nhere on the battlefield? He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have been very\Nconfident in his chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ho-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumb move for a guy who demands\Nhis people call him a wise ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.31,0:10:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old geezer must\Nbe losing his marbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old geezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.21,0:10:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That terrified old gray fella?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know who we're\Ntalking about, young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just met a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was riding a horse all\Ndecked out in sparkly gold gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, he was hard to miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold on his horse, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have been employing\NAurichalcum's saddle ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very high-grade equipment that\Ncan support an extensive array of skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case, it makes sense\Nhow he escaped so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A seriously wearing all gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His fashion sense is as\Nshabby as his attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he escapes across the\Nborder, we cannot go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is a fortress and a heavily\Nguarded bridge that spans the ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no hope of catching up\Nto him by now with normal means.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there was a way for us all to\Nfly together somehow. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that might actually be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assuming that it's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an incredible sight to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being able to see a legendary creature\Nup close and personal like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes living to my old age worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.01,0:11:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be the first time I've ever\Nbeen tasked with healing a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:11:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:12:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've really grown\Nquite a lot, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Noor you? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took me a few minutes to recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been a while since I've seen you. Ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hadn't the slightest\Nidea it was you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're much larger\Nthan you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see that you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not a very nice\Nthing to say now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is well within my abilities to live\Nanother hundred years or more easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're still funny too, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not telling you a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But listen, Nor, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans riding on the back of a dragon\Nseems like a terrible idea to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.41,0:12:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got Rolo with us. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:13:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, Rolo, my boy, are you\Nconfident in this ability of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no confidence at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.75,0:13:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, ho, ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems our dragon is coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.09,0:13:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yes, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you absolutely sure we\Nshould be riding a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it, Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like it's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only from how it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.41,0:13:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lived in the mountains for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wants to get revenge\Nagainst those who hurt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would like you to order it to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have that much communication\Nwith this large dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.75,0:14:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Rolo is a superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dragon thinks Norris...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says it's ready to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're going, get ready. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are going with them as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolo is the only one who\Ncan speak to the dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he'll need as much help as he can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.25,0:14:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And S and I will go to guard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be joining us too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, well, I'm really\Nnot good with heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.23,0:14:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one who came up with the idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I dragged Rolo into this, so it\Nwould be awkward now if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:14:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure, I'm going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.27,0:15:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having you is like the\Nstrength of a hundred!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must continue to look after my patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I believe we\Nhave a duty to diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lump me in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not try to intimidate\Npeople with childish mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.85,0:15:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're the...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thief instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're coming too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.41,0:15:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're going to fly on this giant beast,\Nthen you'll need the concealment skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.65,0:15:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oaken, do you not need to\Nsupervise the stone cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will go as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:16:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe you will be in need of\Na negotiator. Father! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.01,0:16:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you've been\Npretty worried about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you're safe as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.81,0:16:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You chose to return\Ninstead of going to Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm willing to accept my\Npunishment for disobeying your order!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need, it was my own fault for\Ngiving you such an idiotic command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved you made it back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Rain, you are in charge of\Nmaking any judgment calls out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.19,0:16:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, Sir Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, I apologize for always asking,\Nbut please take care of my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, don't even worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get him back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.27,0:16:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now fly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, shouldn't you have\Nsaid something to Noor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just finally found him after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fact is, he never really needed\Nus to play a role in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The idea that we would be able\Nto take him in and raise him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were showing our hubris.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.65,0:17:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was like a hero born\Nstraight out of the legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel pretty silly right now. I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am deeply ashamed of my own laziness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should not have been wasting time thinking\NI was in any position to teach others!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.55,0:18:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am going to retrain myself\Nfrom the beginning now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.67,0:18:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I've been made aware\Nof my own shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot rest on my laurels\Nand let my sword rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.47,0:18:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a guy who's deeply ashamed,\Nyou seem pretty darn happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course, just think of\Nthe spectacle he showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After seeing something\Nlike that, who wouldn't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found anything? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any luck there, Lady Lindbergh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's faster than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.85,0:18:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worst case, he may have already\Narrived back at the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beyond that steel bridge the\Nland turns into empire-controlled
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,territory we cannot just wildly\Nrush in there i know we've come
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a long way but perhaps we should\Nconsider going back your call
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me think then over there\Nsomething is moving extremely fast
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is definitely him,\Nalthough he's nearing the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.21,0:19:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,imperial capital's defenses\Nif we cross into their land
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.39,0:19:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will not make it back\Nin one piece right now we
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.23,0:19:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are still concealed from\Nthem once they become aware
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of our presence the magic\Nwill of course immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lose its effectiveness\Nthat's true but letting him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,escape is not an option\Nthey have powerful magical
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tools and can use them to\Nreinforce their military power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.03,0:19:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot give them any\Nopportunity to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.49,0:19:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are already at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.59,0:20:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we have no idea what awaits us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Rain, Lady Lindbergh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I may, I would like you to grant\Nme permission to obliterate this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obliterate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is going to be\Nour escape route later,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.93,0:20:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it would be smart to take out the\Ndefenses while we have the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In normal situations, Ines would\Nnever suggest exerting her own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she is just as\Nangry as the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.59,0:20:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The royal capital she vowed to risk\Nher life to protect has been flattened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.63,0:20:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as you please, Ines,\Nand do not hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.95,0:20:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that will secure our\Nescape route, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well done, Ines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.09,0:21:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our actions here will determine\Nthe course of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are going to keep pursuing the Emperor\Nall the way to the Imperial Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're ready for this? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone here wields power\Nfar outside the norm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.97,0:21:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the strongest people imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.23,0:21:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no need to worry about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, above all, we have sir. Nor\NI cannot even begin to comprehend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his greatness even now he\NQuietly listens to all around him
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he knows the weight of this\Nmoment we shall teach them A hard
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.59,0:21:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lesson about what happens when\Nyou mess with the wrong people?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.06,0:22:10.02,Freehand 471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs37}#10 I Parry the Emperor's Authority
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.11,0:22:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.51,0:22:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.03,0:22:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story is a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.23,0:22:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The obvious light is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.61,0:22:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.52,0:22:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh

